                                "sense_id": "afe88961-53be-3358-8925-5c1d9052aef7",
                                "text": "Thus, again to quote Mr. Homer Smith, it has been held that 'In general the pastoral incidents serve as an underplot, utterly foreign in spirit to the main plot.'"
